  (text "I/V AND OUTPUT\n- I/V 750R || 2.2n per leg: 5.85 V p-p around +4.65 V. Diff stage gain 0.5 -> ~2.07 Vrms single-ended.\n- Diff stage inputs are crossed (P from IOUT-, N from IOUT+) so the output is not inverted.\n- 4.7 uF film caps block DC into the volume pot. Use 0.1 % resistors in the diff stage."
